(PART C — HORIZONTAL CENTRIFUGAL PUMPS) Tj T*
(1. Horizontal centrifugal pumps for clear cold water shall comply with IS 1520:1980. Duty point) Tj T*
(of each pump shall be 250 m³/h discharge at 45 M total dynamic head.) Tj T*
(2. PUMP CASING SHALL BE CI AND IMPELLER OF LEADED TIN BRONZE. Sound pressure level shall be) Tj T*
(limited to 85 db\(A\) at 1 M distance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PUMP DATA SHEET) Tj T*
(Rated discharge: 250 m³/h) Tj T*
(Total dynamic head: 45 M) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(1. The drive motor shall be a three phase TEFC squirrel cage induction motor as per IS) Tj T*
(325:1996.) Tj T*
(2. Motor rating shall be 37 KW continuous. Motors shall operate satisfactorily on a supply of) Tj T*
(415 Volts ± 10 percent and 50Hz ± 5 percent.) Tj T*
(3. The motor shall be premium efficiency IE3 conforming to IS 12615:2018.) Tj T*
(4. Insulation shall be class F and the motor shall be rated for S1 continuous duty.) Tj T*
(5. Motor speed shall be 1500 rpm \(4 pole\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — TREATED WATER QUALITY) Tj T*
(1. The quality of water supplied shall meet IS 10500:2012.) Tj T*
(2. PH VALUE: 6.5 TO 8.5) Tj T*
(3. TDS of supplied water shall be within 500 mg/l. Turbidity of treated water shall be limited) Tj T*
(to 1 N.T.U..) Tj T*
(4. Fluoride content shall be within 1.0 mg/l.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
