(7. Total coliforms shall be absent in any 100 ml sample.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(1. Performance tests on each pump shall be conducted as per IS 9137 in the presence of the) Tj T*
(Engineer.) Tj T*
(2. PUMPS SHALL CARRY THE BIS STANDARD MARK.) Tj T*
(3. Motors shall be BIS certified and test certificates shall be furnished.) Tj T*
(4. Physico-chemical tests shall follow IS 3025 and bacteriological examination shall follow IS) Tj T*
(1622.) Tj T*
(5. Pre-dispatch inspection shall be offered to the Department's authorised representative with) Tj T*
(15 days notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(1. Monthly water quality reports shall be furnished to the Department. Shop drawings and) Tj T*
(schematic diagrams shall be got approved from the Engineer-in-charge before manufacture.) Tj T*
(2. O&M manuals, as-built drawings and catalogues shall be furnished in triplicate at the time) Tj T*
(of handing over. The supplier shall replace free of cost any part found defective within the) Tj T*
(defect liability period of 24 months.) Tj T*
(3. Training of two operators for one week shall be imparted by the supplier after) Tj T*
(commissioning.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
